{"id":"u-d91726e7-5f59-4821-843c-3a59ebab29b3","src":"community","title":"Primordial","author":"Anonymous","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/ZTyKvq-primordial","desc":"Simple and effective way to get jacked and strong.\nThere are 2 ways to do this split \n\nFirst way -Normal 3 day split \nSo Upper Lower and Upper  (2 times frequency for upper body and 1 time for \nlower)\nMight be for busier people, upper body focused people or an athlete who is just trying to get jacked and strong. Legs are heavily used in every sport so having 2 leg days might cook your CNS.\n\nSecond way - 3 day one 1 or 2 day off repeat \n\nThis means each week will be different (you won’t have a specific day for specific workout), it’ll change depending on the rotation. If you are someone who needs a fixed routine to stay disciplined then I do not suggest this method however note that if you want the maximum result then this way might be a little more beneficial to you. \n\nMake sure to eat good , sleep good and do cardio for the heart.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":80,"joins":10,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-15T03:31:16.325Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Upper","Day 2","Day 3"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Smith Machine)","sets":[{"lo":4,"hi":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Wide Grip Pull-Up","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Pec Deck (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":10}]},{"n":"Reverse Pec Deck","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Kelso Shrug","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":10,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Seated Hamstring Curl","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Leg Extension","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Hack Squat","sets":[{"lo":4,"hi":8}]},{"n":"Leg Press","sets":[{"lo":4,"hi":8}]},{"n":"Hip Adductor (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi